FILE>>>|undertale.sc_alias

confirm ♦️ 1090 ♦️ Z: Confirm 
cancel ♦️ 1088 ♦️ X: Cancel
menu ♦️ 1067 ♦️ C: Menu In Game
fullscreen ♦️ 1115 ♦️ F4: Toggle Fullscreen
quit ♦️ 1027 ♦️ Escape: Hold escape
up ♦️ 1038 ♦️ Up: Confirm Menu and action
right ♦️ 1039 ♦️ Right: Confirm Menu and action
down ♦️ 1040 ♦️ Down: Confirm Menu and action
left ♦️ 1037 ♦️ Left: Confirm Menu and action


FILE>>>|undertale.string_to_commands

# Example
# ⌘confirm ⌘cancel ⌘menu ⌘fullscreen ⌘quit

confirm ♦️ sc:confirm⬇️ 100> confirm⬆️ ♦️ Z: Confirm 
cancel ♦️ sc:cancel⬇️ 100> cancel⬆️  ♦️ X: Cancel
menu ♦️ sc:menu⬇️ 100> menu⬆️  ♦️ C: Menu In Game
fullscreen ♦️ sc:fullscreen⬇️ 100> fullscreen⬆️  ♦️ F4: Toggle Fullscreen
quit ♦️ sc:quit⬇️ 2000> quit⬆️  ♦️ Escape: Hold escape

# Example
# ⌘start_move_up ⌘stop_move_up ⌘start_move_down ⌘stop_move_down
# ⌘start_move_right ⌘stop_move_right ⌘start_move_left ⌘stop_move_left

start_move_up ♦️ sc:up⬇️ ♦️ Up: Start move up
stop_move_up ♦️ sc:up⬆️ ♦️ Up: Stop move up

start_move_right ♦️ sc:right⬇️ ♦️ right: Start move  right
stop_move_right ♦️ sc:right⬆️ ♦️ right:  Stop move right

start_move_down ♦️ sc:down⬇️ ♦️ down: Start move down
stop_move_down ♦️ sc:down⬆️ ♦️ down: Stop move down

start_move_left ♦️ sc:left⬇️ ♦️left: Start move left
stop_move_left ♦️ sc:left⬆️ ♦️ left: Stop move left




# Example
# ⌘🤖ok ⌘🤖no ⌘🤖back

🤖ok ♦️ ⌘confirm
🤖no♦️ ⌘cancel
🤖back♦️ ⌘menu

# Example
# ⌘⬆️1 ⌘⬆️0 ⌘⬇️1 ⌘⬇️0
# ⌘⬅️1 ⌘⬅️0 ⌘➡️1 ⌘➡️0

⬆️1 ♦️ sc:up⬇️ ♦️ Up: Start move up
⬆️0 ♦️ sc:up⬆️ ♦️ Up: Stop move up

➡️1 ♦️ sc:right⬇️ ♦️ right: Start move  right
➡️0 ♦️ sc:right⬆️ ♦️ right:  Stop move right

⬇️1 ♦️ sc:down⬇️ ♦️ down: Start move down
⬇️0 ♦️ sc:down⬆️ ♦️ down: Stop move down

⬅️1 ♦️ sc:left⬇️ ♦️left: Start move left
⬅️0 ♦️ sc:left⬆️ ♦️ left: Stop move left




